+### Bursts and Stalls
+
+A card "bursts" when it gets a sudden spike of attention: three or more comments
+from at least two people within a third of the board's auto-close period, or an
+assignment, or a reopen. A card that had a burst and then sees no activity for
+two weeks is "stalled". See `Card::Stallable`; the card bubble announces it and
+the cards index lists them with `indexed_by=stalled`.
+
